edestrian stop light","illustrator":"James Woolley","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2014"},{"page":8,"title":"Robot looking at a snout","illustrator":"James Woolley","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2014"},{"page":9,"title":"Robot licked by a dog","illustrator":"James Woolley","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2014"},{"page":10,"title":"Robot holding a button at a pedestrian crossing","illustrator":"James Woolley","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2014"},{"page":11,"title":"Robot splashed by a car","illustrator":"James Woolley","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2014"},{"page":12,"title":"Robot holding a button over its head","illustrator":"James Woolley","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2014"},{"page":13,"title":"Doll with one eye missing","illustrator":"James Woolley","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2014"},{"page":14,"title":"Robot and a doll","illustrator":"James Woolley","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2014"},{"page":15,"title":"Robot looking at buttons","illustrator":"James Woolley","holder":"Book Dash","year":"2014"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಟಿನ್ ಟಿನ್ ಹೀಗೆ ದಾರಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಕುಳಿತಿದ್ದಾಗ","ಬಟನ್‌ ಒಂದು ಎದುರಿಗೇ ಚಿಮ್ಮಿತು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಈ ಬಟನ್‌ ಎಲ್ಲಿಂದ ಬಂದಿರಬಹುದಪ್ಪ,” ಎಂದುಕೊಂಡಿತು.","ಟಿನ್ ಅದನ್ನು ಕಂಡು ಹಿಡಿಯಲು ಹೊರಟಿತು."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ದಾರಿಯ ಬದಿಯಲ್ಲಂತೂ ಜನವೋ ಜನ.","“ಅಯ್ಯಪ್ಪ!” ಅದು ಅಪ್ಪಚ್ಚಿಯೇ ಆಯಿತು."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅಂತೂ ಇಂತೂ ಬುಟ್ಟ ಬಚಾವಾಗಿಬಿಟ್ಟ.","“ಅಬ್ಬಬ್ಬಾ, ಎಷ್ಟು ಭಯವಾಗಿತ್ತೋ ನನಗೆ,”","ಎಂದಿತು ಟಿನ್."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಏನಪ್ಪಾ, ಇದು ನಿಮ್ಮದಾ?”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಆ ಹಸಿರು ಮನುಷ್ಯ ಏನೂ ಹೇಳಲಿಲ್ಲ.","ಆದರೆ, ಕೆಂಪಗಾಗಿಬಿಟ್ಟ.","“ಅದೆಷ್ಟು ಒರಟು ಮನುಷ್ಯನೋ.”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಟಿನ್‌ ಟಿನ್ ಹುಡುಕುತ್ತಾ ಹೋದ.","“ಯಾರದು ಈ ಬಟನ್ನೂ?”"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಆಹ್..!‌ ...ಸದ್ಯ ಇವನು ಹತ್ತಿರದವನು ಎನ್ನಿಸಿದ.”"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ನಾನೀಗ ಆಚೆ ಬದಿಗೆ ಹೋಗಬೇಕು.","ನನಗಂತೂ ಇದು ಅಲ್ಲಿಂದಲೇ ಬಂದಿರಬೇಕು ಎನಿಸುತ್ತಿದೆ.”"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಪಚಕ್! “ಕೂದಲೆಳೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಪಾರಾದೆ.”","ಈಗ ಅದು ರಸ್ತೆ ದಾಟುವ ಮೊದಲು","ಕಾರುಗಳೆಲ್ಲಾ ಹೋಗಲಿ ಎಂದು ಕಾಯುತ್ತಿತ್ತು."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಬಹುಶಃ ಅದು ಇವನನ್ನೇ ಹುಡುಕುತ್ತಿತ್ತೋ ಏನೋ.","“ಏಯ್‌, ಯಾರು ನೀನು?”"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ನಾನು ಚಿಂದಿ ಚುಮ್ಮಿ.”","“ಇದು ನಿನ್ನದೇ ಇರಬೇಕು,”","ಎಂದಿತು ಟಿನ್."]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಥ್ಯಾಂಕ್ಯು ಪುಟಾಣಿ ರೊಬೊ.","ನಾವಿಬ್ಬರೂ ಗೆಳೆಯರಾಗೋಣವಾ?”"]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/593603-yaaradidu-button/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]}],"wordCount":104}